WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
When the work is done, remove
tools and put the guards back.

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.248
Make sure everyone is clear.

3
00:00:06.248 --> 00:00:09.443
Then each person removes
only their own lock.

4
00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:11.218
If a lock is left behind,

5
00:00:11.218 --> 00:00:15.123
only a supervisor may remove
it, following plant rules.

6
00:00:15.123 --> 00:00:19.525
Before restart, tell the affected
employees the locks are off.

7
00:00:19.525 --> 00:00:24.353
Never work on a machine that isn't
locked out, even for a quick job.

8
00:00:24.353 --> 00:00:26.057
If unsure, stop and ask.

9
00:00:26.057 --> 00:00:28.186
Now let's check what you know.
